@startuml
title Node Lifecycle State Machine
left to right direction
hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 14
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor Black
}

state "DISCOVERED" as Discovered
state "ASSIGNED" as Assigned
state "ONLINE" as Online
state "OFFLINE" as Offline
state "DISABLED" as Disabled
state "DELETED" as Deleted

[*] --> Discovered : discovery received
Discovered --> Assigned : assign role and location
Assigned --> Online : heartbeat received
Online --> Offline : heartbeat timeout
Offline --> Online : heartbeat resumes
Assigned --> Disabled : disable
Online --> Disabled : disable
Offline --> Disabled : disable
Disabled --> Assigned : enable
Assigned --> Discovered : unassign
Online --> Discovered : unassign
Offline --> Discovered : unassign
Discovered --> Deleted : delete eligible record
Disabled --> Deleted : delete eligible record
Deleted --> [*]

note bottom of Discovered
UNKNOWN is a display fallback,
not a stored lifecycle state.
end note
@enduml
